<title>UK: TABLE - Jardine Intl Motor posts year profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Jardine Intl Motor posts year profit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>		     (million U.S. dollars unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (cents)		14.43		  vs 22.44</p>
<p> Dividend (cents)	 6.30		   vs N/A</p>
<p> Total dividend (cents) 7.50		   vs 7.50</p>
<p> Pretax		     83.8		   vs 119.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   2,007.4		vs 1,866.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Previous year results included an exceptional profit of $43.8 million on the disposal of its stake in an instalment finance business.</p>
<p>The company said that given the mixed outlook for markets in 1997, &quot;the group will do well to match last year's earnings&quot;.</p>
<p>Full company name - Jardine International Motor Holdings Ltd, a member of the Jardine Matheson Holdings Ltd group. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
